              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            "The consultation was incredibly valuable. They walked me through every step and 
            helped me save over $200,000 in taxes on my apartment building sale."
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">- Sarah M., Commercial Investor</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="flex text-yellow-400">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
