            "Professional, knowledgeable, and responsive. They made my first 1031 exchange 
            stress-free and saved me a fortune in taxes."
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">- Michael R., Real Estate Investor</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg">
